  "goodToKnow": "Hysterisch means hysterical: hysterisch lachen, eine hysterische Debatte. Die Hysterie is hysteria: Massenhysterie. The word comes from Greek hystera (womb), from the old idea that it was a women's illness; because of this, calling a woman hysterisch is often seen as sexist. Medicine no longer uses Hysterie as a diagnosis. Synonyms: überdreht, panisch, außer sich."
